# --- Personal data exports — DPDP Act 2023, never track (2026-08-06) ---
# `prospect_leads_export.csv` reached the ROOT of this PUBLIC repo carrying 200
# real businesses' name/phone/address/email/pitch/wa_link. `data/*` above did not
# cover it because the file sat at the repo root. These patterns are deliberately
# root-anchored AND recursive. Lead data belongs in Postgres or encrypted object
# storage with source, collection date, legal basis, suppression state and
# retention deadline — only synthetic fixtures belong in Git.
# Guard test: tests/test_no_tracked_pii_exports.py
# Note: root CSV is NOT under Dockerfile.lock `COPY data/` — image rebuild is
# unnecessary for this containment; history purge (owner-run) remains separate.
/*.csv
prospect*.csv
*_leads*.csv
*leads_export*.csv
*prospects_export*.csv
*outreach_export*.csv
!tests/fixtures/**/*.csv
!.claude/skills/**/*.csv
.env.production
.env.local

